flowchart TB
  subgraph DEVICE[Device trust boundary / local-first]
    CAM[Camera] --> ID[SHA-256 identity]
    PDF[PDF / images / supporting evidence] --> ID
    ID --> ORIG[Encrypted immutable original storage]
    ORIG --> TEXT[PDF text-first path]
    ORIG --> PRE[Image preprocessing]
    PRE --> OCR[On-device offline OCR]
    OCR --> CAND[Candidates + confidence]
    TEXT --> PARSE[Generic structure parser]
    CAND --> PARSE
    PARSE --> VAL[Deterministic consistency validation]
    VAL --> CONF[User confirmation when needed]
    TEXT --> CONF
    CONF --> GRAPH[Provenance / Evidence Graph]
    GRAPH --> DB[Encrypted structured DB]
    RULE[Immutable versioned Rule Pack] --> ENG[Pure-Kotlin deterministic rule engine]
    MAP[Versioned Mapping Pack] --> ENG
    REF[Versioned Reference Pack] --> PLAUS[Plausibility engine]
    DB --> ENG
    DB --> PLAUS
    ENG --> COV[Coverage model]
    PLAUS --> COV
    COV --> FIND[Findings: proven / conditional / warning / not checkable]
    FIND --> REPORT[Report + calculations + source trace]
    REPORT --> LETTER[Deterministic letter]
    REPORT --> DOSSIER[Inspection dossier]
    REPORT --> PACK[Evidence Package]
    PACK --> ENC[Password encryption]
    ENC --> MAN[SHA-256 integrity manifest]
  end
  subgraph EXTERNAL[External / user-controlled boundary]
    BILL[Google Play Billing]
    SIGN[Optional Google sign-in]
    TEL[Opt-in Firebase Analytics / Crashlytics]
    SHARE[Android Share Sheet / user-selected destination]
  end
  ENG -. no entitlement dependency .- BILL
  DB -. no case content .- TEL
  REPORT --> SHARE
